      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PICKLE HEAD (8) hit the frame on debut then last start flew the lids and led throughout to get off the mark with maiden win, scoring by 1.75 lengths at this track over 305m (18.11). Has good ability and looks hard to top. FLASH MARSHALL (1) missed the frame latest when sixth at this track (24.35) but scored three back at this track (17.84). Has a solid record over this journey. The form out of last race has been strong. Key runner on best form. FRENCH BLONDE (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (23.11) last time in a Bottom Up - Restricted Win at Warrnambool. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from seven starts. Has ability and can measure up. CADILLAC CLASS (5) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can make amends.",
